# The entire theoretical process

The program is basically doing this:

text
              CIPHERTEXT
                   │
                   ▼
          ┌─────────────────┐
          │ Know key length │
          └────────┬────────┘
                   │
                   ▼
       Separate ciphertext into
       groups based on position
                   │
                   ▼
       ┌───────────┼───────────┐
       ▼           ▼           ▼
     Group 1     Group 2     Group 3 ...
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
    Counter     Counter     Counter
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
 Most common  Most common  Most common
    letter       letter       letter
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
 Assume it is   Assume it is  Assume it is
      E              E             E
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
Calculate key  Calculate key Calculate key
   shift          shift         shift
       │           │           │
       └───────────┼─────────────┘
                   ▼
             GUESSED KEY
                   │
                   ▼
             Vigenère
             decryption
                   │
                   ▼
              PLAINTEXT



